    'aries-love-compatibility',
    'Aries love compatibility: the signs that ignite them (and the ones that burn out)',
    'Aries love compatibility: who can actually keep up?',
    'Aries falls fast, loves hard, and moves on quickly when the spark dies. Find out which zodiac signs can truly match their fire, and which ones fizzle out.',
    'Aries astrological symbol, love compatibility',
    'Aries falls fast, loves hard, and moves on quickly when the spark dies. Which signs can truly keep up?',
    '<p>Aries doesn''t wait around. They want, they chase, they love, and if the other person can''t match their pace, they''re already looking ahead. That''s not shallowness. It''s just that <strong>Aries operates at a speed most people simply can''t sustain</strong>. In love, this energy cuts both ways: it makes the early days of a relationship electrifying like few other signs can, but it can also consume a story before it ever has time to settle. To see whether your pairing can handle this intensity, <a href="/en/zodiac-signs-names-compatibility/">check your astrological and name compatibility</a> in just a few clicks.</p>
<p>Ruled by Mars, the planet of action and desire, Aries needs a partner who pushes back, not someone who gives in at the first sign of tension, but someone who answers, who challenges, who doesn''t fade into the background. For Aries, real connection is built through movement. Not through quiet comfort.</p>
<p>So who can actually go the distance alongside them? Here''s what the stars, and a healthy dose of common sense, have to say about each of their pairings.</p>',
    '["Leo and Libra are their best matches, for completely different reasons.","Two Aries together is pure fire. Literally.","Cancer and Virgo: two combinations that demand a lot of effort for very little natural ease.","Sagittarius is similar enough to understand them, different enough not to bore them.","Their biggest challenge in love: accepting that someone moves slower without leaving them behind."]'::jsonb,
    '[{"id":"what-aries-truly-needs-in-love","title":"What Aries truly needs in love","content":"<p>Before looking at the sign-by-sign scores, there''s something fundamental to understand about Aries: <strong>they need to be surprised</strong>. A predictable partner who always says yes, who never pushes them to their limits, that bores them. Fast. What Aries calls \"passion\" is often that productive tension between two wills that don''t quite align.</p>\n<p>Their strongest matches are rarely with signs that mirror them completely. Leo (9/10) stimulates Aries because Leo stands their ground with the same fierce pride. Libra (9/10), their zodiac opposite, fascinates them precisely because Libra operates in reverse, where Aries charges ahead, Libra weighs every angle. Where Aries speaks their mind, Libra searches for the perfect word. For Aries, that difference is pure attraction.</p>\n<p>On the other end, the hardest pairings for Aries are the ones that ask them to slow down without offering something in return for that effort. Cancer (4/10) asks Aries to manage emotions they don''t always know how to read. Virgo (4/10) asks them to think before acting, which goes against everything they are. These relationships can work, but they never come naturally.</p>\n<p>One thing to remember if you are an Aries or you love one: <strong>their flaws in love are the same as their strengths</strong>. The impulsiveness that makes the beginning of a relationship thrilling is the same thing that can blow it apart later. That''s not fate, it''s just terrain that needs work.</p>","subsections":[]},{"id":"compatibilite-signe-par-signe","title":"Sign-by-sign compatibility","content":"\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Aries + Aries</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Two Aries (two Fire signs ruled by Mars) form an extremely passionate duo. Their relationship is very &quot;passionate and explosive,&quot; full of energy and spontaneity. They live their love intensely, but their impulsiveness and matching egos frequently cause conflicts. Their union is exciting, but they must learn to calm their impulses for the relationship to last.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">5<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Aries + Taurus</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#ea580c\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Cardinal Fire) and Taurus (Fixed Earth) have opposite temperaments. Aries is impulsive and rushed (ruled by Mars), while Taurus is stable and patient (ruled by Venus). This elemental difference (Fire vs. Earth) leads to daily friction: Taurus may find Aries reckless, and Aries judges Taurus as too slow. Their attraction stems from this complementarity (energy vs. stability), but their harmony requires major compromises and mutual understanding.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Aries + Gemini</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Gemini (Air) form a very lively and dynamic couple. Both share a thirst for freedom and adventure. Aries acts with passion, and the curious, adaptable Gemini constantly stimulates Aries with their quick wit. Their relationship is full of shared projects: Aries brings the drive to act, and Gemini brings fresh ideas. They avoid routine and understand each other well, though they must be careful to temper Aries'' impulsiveness against Gemini''s occasional indecision.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">4<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Aries + Cancer</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Cancer (Water) struggle to harmonize. Their compatibility is low because they don''t share the same element. Cancer looks toward the future and emotional security, while Aries lives in the moment. Cancer may feel ignored by the impetuous Aries, and Aries might get annoyed by Cancer''s sensitivity. Their relationship can be deep if true love unites them, but they must accept major compromises: Cancer teaches Aries to consider feelings, and Aries teaches Cancer to trust the impulse of the present.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Aries + Leo</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Leo (Fire) share a strong elemental affinity. Their union is very intense and passionate. Both are proud and energetic: Aries and Leo create a relationship full of power and fervor. They stimulate each other and never lack excitement, but they can become competitive (both want to shine). If each respects the other''s pride, their couple is very strong and physical.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">4<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Aries + Virgo</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Virgo (Earth) do not have the same pace of life. Virgo thinks long and hard before acting, while Aries charges headfirst. Aries dislikes the rules and rigor that Virgo imposes, creating conflict. Conversely, Virgo admires Aries'' boldness but is irritated by their recklessness. Their relationship is therefore tense: the lack of elemental affinity (Fire vs. Earth) complicates compatibility. To work, they must greatly adapt to one another.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Aries + Libra</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Libra (Air) are opposites in the zodiac, creating a very strong complementarity. The calm, diplomatic Libra tempers Aries'' impulsiveness, and the passionate Aries warms Libra''s heart. It''s a &quot;perfect&quot; combination in love: Libra brings harmony and control to Aries, who in turn brings energy and frankness. Together, they unite their differences to form a solid balance.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fcd34d;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fffbeb;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fcd34d;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#d97706;\">6<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#78350f;margin:0;\">Aries + Scorpio</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Scorpio (Water) form a very intense and complex relationship. Scorpio (Fixed, ruled by Mars/Pluto) is enigmatic and passionate, while Aries (Cardinal Fire) is direct and energetic. Their couple can experience unbridled passion: Scorpio feeds Aries'' strength, and Aries energizes Scorpio. But they have contradictory impulses (Scorpio likes to test, Aries likes to charge) that can lead to dangerous conflicts. They might experience the &quot;ultimate love of their lives&quot; or suffer violent arguments if neither channels their intensity.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Aries + Sagittarius</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Sagittarius (Fire) share great affinity. The optimistic and calm Sagittarius encourages Aries to think before acting. Together, they create a sweet and dynamic relationship. Both are drawn to adventure: the more patient Sagittarius is, the more Aries opens up to their advice, filling their life together with travel and discovery. They teach each other the taste for combat and adventure, making their couple very close.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">5<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Aries + Capricorn</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#ea580c\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Capricorn (Earth) are two opposing cardinal signs. The cold, composed Capricorn acts like a &quot;wall of ice&quot; against Aries'' ardor. Aries brings enthusiasm; Capricorn brings stability. They can build a balanced long-term relationship (they share ambition and willpower), but their association requires effort: Aries teaches Capricorn patience and a sense of the future, while Capricorn teaches Aries to think before charging. Their union is solid, occasionally punctuated by intense passions.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Aries + Aquarius</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Aquarius (Air) get along very well thanks to their shared need for freedom. They both respect each other''s independence and communicate harmoniously. Their relationship isn''t weighed down by excessive demands: they understand each other''s dreams and visions. The more detached Aquarius balances the more passionate Aries. It''s one of the happiest couples in the zodiac, even if they must be careful not to hurt each other (e.g., differences over intimacy).</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fcd34d;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fffbeb;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fcd34d;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#d97706;\">6<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#78350f;margin:0;\">Aries + Pisces</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Aries (Fire) and Pisces (Water) form a deeply emotional combination. Together, they can experience great passion and mutual devotion. Aries, usually aggressive, is softened by the devotion of Pisces, who invests themselves completely. They can create an intense chemistry: Pisces comforts Aries, who in turn brings liveliness. However, since their elements are opposite (Fire vs. Water), the relationship requires a lot of understanding: without true love, their differences (Aries'' haste vs. Pisces'' daydreaming) can cause tension.</p>\n</div>","subsections":[]},{"id":"discover-more","title":"Discover more","content":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/taurus-love-compatibility/\">Taurus love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/gemini-love-compatibility/\">Gemini love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/cancer-love-compatibility/\">Cancer love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/leo-love-compatibility/\">Leo love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/virgo-love-compatibility/\">Virgo love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/libra-love-compatibility/\">Libra love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/scorpio-love-compatibility/\">Scorpio love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/sagittarius-love-compatibility/\">Sagittarius love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/capricorn-love-compatibility/\">Capricorn love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/aquarius-love-compatibility/\">Aquarius love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/pisces-love-compatibility/\">Pisces love compatibility</a></li>\n</ul>","subsections":[]}]'::jsonb,
    true
  )
