  -- Translation: en
  INSERT INTO public.blog_article_translations (article_id, lang, slug, title, meta_title, meta_description, featured_image_alt, excerpt, introduction, quick_summary, sections, is_complete)
  VALUES (
    art_id,
    'en',
    'libra-love-compatibility',
    'Libra love compatibility: the signs that help them find their anchor',
    'Libra love compatibility: who helps them choose?',
    'Libra craves harmony in love, sometimes to the point of never deciding. Discover which signs finally make them want to commit, and which ones complicate everything.',
    'Libra astrological symbol, love compatibility',
    'Libra craves harmony in love, sometimes to the point of never deciding. Which signs make them want to commit?',
    '<p>Libra has a reputation for being indecisive. That''s not entirely wrong, but it''s not the whole truth either. <strong>They''re not trying to avoid choices. They''re searching for the right choice.</strong> The one that doesn''t hurt anyone, that preserves harmony, that respects both sides of the equation. Sometimes that choice doesn''t exist, and that''s when Libra stays suspended, weighing an invisible scale. If you''re wondering whether your sign is the one that can help Libra find their footing, <a href="/en/zodiac-signs-names-compatibility/">our zodiac and name compatibility tool</a> has the answer.</p>
<p>Ruled by Venus like Taurus, but with a very different flavour, Libra is oriented toward the other person. They think in terms of partnership almost instinctively, which makes them an attentive, generous partner, but also someone who can lose sight of their own needs in the pursuit of balance.</p>
<p>In love, Libra is looking above all for someone they feel at ease with, not threatened, not judged, not pressured. <strong>They need gentleness, shared aesthetics, conversations that go somewhere.</strong> And they need, even if they won''t say it out loud, for the other person to sometimes make decisions for them, with care, without bulldozing.</p>',
    '["Gemini, Aquarius, Sagittarius: the partners whose conversations never run dry.","Aries, their opposite, draws them in with a frankness and spontaneity they struggle to embody themselves.","Capricorn and Cancer: two unions that can work but push Libra out of their comfort zone.","Libra doesn''t flee commitment, they flee imposed decisions. Important distinction.","What they truly want: a partner who decides without bulldozing them."]'::jsonb,
    '[{"id":"what-their-compatibilities-reveal","title":"What their compatibilities reveal about what they need","content":"<p>With Gemini and Aquarius (9/10 each), Libra finds an intellectual lightness that suits them perfectly. These two Air signs don''t overwhelm them emotionally, they exchange with Libra on equal footing, without ever imposing their worldview.</p>\n<p>Aries (8/10 to 9/10), their zodiac opposite, is a more complicated story. On paper, everything separates Libra and Aries. And yet, or maybe precisely because of that, something often clicks between them. <strong>Aries does for Libra what they can''t do for themselves: they decide, they charge forward, they make the call.</strong> And Libra, watching from the sidelines, finds themselves admiring Aries for exactly the quality they lack.</p>\n<p>Capricorn (3/10) is their most thankless pairing. Not because Capricorn is a bad partner, but because their severity, their austere approach to life, their distaste for light conversation creates in Libra a persistent sense of discomfort. Libra feels judged, even when they''re not.</p>","subsections":[]},{"id":"compatibilite-signe-par-signe","title":"Sign-by-sign compatibility","content":"\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Libra + Aries</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Aries (Fire) are opposites, producing a unique chemistry. The balanced Libra tempers Aries'' impetuousness, and Aries awakens Libra to action. Together, they balance their differences: Aries brings passion and frankness, Libra brings diplomacy and romance. It''s a dynamic relationship where each values the other''s qualities.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">5<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Libra + Taurus</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#ea580c\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Taurus (Earth) share the planet Venus but differ on the essentials. The sociable, aesthetic Libra loves discussion; Taurus loves quiet and concrete pleasures. They might agree on a shared taste for comfort, but Taurus may find Libra too indecisive, and Libra finds Taurus too possessive. Compatibility depends on their ability to reconcile intellectual harmony with material stability.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Libra + Gemini</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Gemini (Air) share the same element. Both are outwardly focused and love to communicate. Libra brings diplomacy and a sense of justice to the curious Gemini, and Gemini enriches Libra with their quick mind. Their relationship is light, cultured, and very harmonious as they both value conversation and social harmony.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">4<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Libra + Cancer</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Cancer (Water) often struggle to find balance. The highly emotional Cancer may find Libra too superficial or distant, while Libra may judge Cancer as too possessive or moody. Their expectations differ: Cancer seeks a warm, deep home; Libra seeks harmony and intellectual sharing. They must work on mutual understanding for the relationship to function.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Libra + Leo</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Leo (Fire) can get along incredibly well. The peaceful Libra softens the impulsive Leo, while the royal Leo brings passion and recognition to Libra. They both love being surrounded by people and enjoying life. Their relationship is often beautiful and creative, with Libra admiring Leo''s charisma and Leo charmed by Libra''s elegance.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">4<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Libra + Virgo</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Virgo (Earth) have opposing ways of thinking. Libra seeks lightness and beauty; Virgo seeks precision and efficiency. Their values differ: Libra may find Virgo too nitpicky and reserved, and Virgo finds Libra too indecisive. They must respect these differences: Libra teaches Virgo not to take themselves too seriously, and Virgo teaches Libra how to actualize ideas.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fcd34d;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fffbeb;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fcd34d;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#d97706;\">7<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#78350f;margin:0;\">Libra + Libra</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#d97706\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Natural harmony between two Libras. Both seek balance, beauty, and diplomacy in the relationship. They share a taste for aesthetics and avoid conflict. However, the relationship may lack decisiveness, as both tend toward indecision.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">4<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Libra + Scorpio</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Scorpio (Water) are very different emotionally. The intense, jealous Scorpio can make Libra uncomfortable, and Libra can seem superficial to the passionate Scorpio. Their relationship involves compromises: Libra must accept Scorpio''s depth, and Scorpio must show more social flexibility for balance to exist.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fcd34d;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fffbeb;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fcd34d;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#d97706;\">7<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#78350f;margin:0;\">Libra + Sagittarius</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d97706\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#d97706\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Sagittarius (Fire) generally have a good understanding. The harmonious Libra appreciates Sagittarius'' optimism, and Sagittarius is drawn to Libra''s charm and diplomacy. Both love intellectual journeys: they gladly discuss philosophies and new projects together. Their relationship is generally positive and balanced, though each must sometimes make concessions for Sagittarius'' blunt honesty.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fef2f2;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fca5a5;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#dc2626;\">3<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7f1d1d;margin:0;\">Libra + Capricorn</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#dc2626\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Capricorn (Earth) have very different interests. The ambitious, realistic Capricorn can seem too austere to Libra, who prefers ideals and beauty. Their vision of life diverges: Libra seeks fairness in the immediate, while Capricorn plans for the long term. Their compatibility is limited without major compromises.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Libra + Aquarius</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Aquarius (Air) share strong elemental affinity. Both are free-spirited and open to the world. They love discussing new ideas and acting for causes close to their hearts. Their relationship is very fluid and intellectual: they stimulate each other and maintain great harmony thanks to their shared progressive vision and sense of justice.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">4<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Libra + Pisces</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Libra (Air) and Pisces (Water) have different emotional expectations. The balanced Libra may struggle to understand Pisces'' highly emotional nature. The dreamy Pisces may judge Libra as too rational or hesitant. Their relationship works if both compromise: Libra must show more empathy, and Pisces must learn to communicate needs more explicitly.</p>\n</div>","subsections":[]},{"id":"discover-more","title":"Discover more","content":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/aries-love-compatibility/\">Aries love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/taurus-love-compatibility/\">Taurus love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/gemini-love-compatibility/\">Gemini love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/cancer-love-compatibility/\">Cancer love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/leo-love-compatibility/\">Leo love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/virgo-love-compatibility/\">Virgo love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/scorpio-love-compatibility/\">Scorpio love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/sagittarius-love-compatibility/\">Sagittarius love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/capricorn-love-compatibility/\">Capricorn love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/aquarius-love-compatibility/\">Aquarius love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/pisces-love-compatibility/\">Pisces love compatibility</a></li>\n</ul>","subsections":[]}]'::jsonb,
