    'Capricorn astrological symbol, love compatibility',
    'Capricorn doesn''t commit lightly, and when they do, it''s to build something real. Which signs share that vision?',
    '<p>Capricorn has a reputation for being cold in love. That''s a misunderstanding. <strong>They''re not cold, they''re serious.</strong> And in a world where love is often treated as entertainment, their seriousness can read as distance. But those who have been loved by a Capricorn know: once they choose someone, they don''t turn back. Want to find out if your sign is compatible with that kind of solidity? <a href="/en/zodiac-signs-names-compatibility/">Calculate your love compatibility by sign and name</a>.</p>
<p>Ruled by Saturn, the planet of discipline and time, Capricorn builds relationships the way they build everything else: with patience, rigour, and a long-term vision. They don''t fall in love easily, but when they do, it''s with a depth few signs can match.</p>
<p>What Capricorn expects from a partner isn''t blind passion, it''s reliability. <strong>They want someone they can count on, someone who keeps their promises, someone who doesn''t disappear when things get hard.</strong> For them, love is proven over time, not through declarations.</p>',
    '["Taurus, Virgo, Scorpio: their three most solid and enduring unions.","With Cancer, their opposite, they form a complementary couple, stability meets emotion.","Aries and Sagittarius: two signs too impulsive for their measured pace.","Capricorn isn''t distant, they''re selective. They protect their heart before offering it.","What they seek: a reliable partner who understands that love is a marathon, not a sprint."]'::jsonb,
    '[{"id":"strongest-alliances-and-friction-points","title":"Their strongest alliances, and their friction points","content":"<p>Taurus (9/10) is arguably their most natural partner. These two Earth signs share the same values: stability, patience, a taste for things done well. Together, they build something tangible, a home, a family, a project, and they do it with a solidity other couples envy.</p>\n<p>Virgo (9/10) understands Capricorn in a way few signs can. Their intelligence runs along the same lines, analytical, pragmatic, oriented toward improvement. They don''t get lost in unnecessary drama. <strong>It''s a couple that works because both have their feet on the ground, and they like it that way.</strong></p>\n<p>Scorpio (8/10) brings Capricorn an emotional depth they sometimes struggle to express on their own. Scorpio pushes Capricorn to go beyond the surface, to name what they feel. And Capricorn gives Scorpio the structure and security they need to lower their guard.</p>\n<p>Cancer (7/10), their zodiac opposite, is a pairing of contrasts. Cancer feels everything intensely; Capricorn analyses before feeling. But together, they can create a remarkable balance, if Cancer accepts Capricorn''s emotional reserve, and if Capricorn accepts Cancer''s emotional tides.</p>\n<p>Aries (3/10) is a difficult match. Aries wants everything, right now, Capricorn prefers to take their time. <strong>Aries''s impatience exasperates Capricorn, and Capricorn''s slowness frustrates Aries.</strong> The two can admire each other from a distance, but living together demands compromises neither enjoys making.</p>\n<p>Two Capricorns together (7/10)? A serious, structured, ambitious relationship, but one that risks lacking lightness. This couple needs to learn to laugh together, to let go sometimes, to remember that love can''t be reduced to a shared project.</p>","subsections":[]},{"id":"compatibilite-signe-par-signe","title":"Sign-by-sign compatibility","content":"\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">5<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Aries</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#ea580c\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Aries (Fire) can form an ambitious but antagonistic team. The patient Capricorn acts as a &quot;wall of ice&quot; against Aries'' ardor. Aries breathes momentum into the couple; Capricorn brings structure. Together, they share ambition and can build something solid if they compromise.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Taurus</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Taurus (Earth) have highly elevated compatibility. They share pragmatic values: hard work, stability, loyalty. Taurus supports Capricorn''s ambition with constancy, and Capricorn reassures Taurus with reliability. Their relationship is solid and built to last.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fff7ed;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fdba74;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#ea580c;\">4<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7c2d12;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Gemini</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Gemini (Air) have little in common. The ambitious, disciplined Capricorn finds Gemini too superficial, and Gemini finds Capricorn too serious. Their relationship lacks natural communication and requires effort to balance.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Cancer</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Cancer (Water) form a highly complementary couple. The warm, protective Cancer reassures Capricorn and builds a loving home. The ambitious, stable Capricorn offers Cancer the security and structure they need. They project their energy into the same family and material goals.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fef2f2;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fca5a5;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#dc2626;\">3<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7f1d1d;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Leo</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#dc2626\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Leo (Fire) have opposing values. The career-driven Capricorn may judge Leo as too selfish or spendthrift. Leo, in turn, may find Capricorn too rigid. Their relationship requires massive adaptation to work.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">9<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Virgo</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#059669\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Virgo (Earth) share the same pragmatic energy. This duo aims for efficiency: the meticulous Virgo supports Capricorn''s projects with precision, and Capricorn appreciates Virgo''s reliability. They share a sense of duty and organization.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fef2f2;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fca5a5;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#dc2626;\">3<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7f1d1d;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Libra</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#dc2626\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Libra (Air) struggle to find common ground. The hardworking Capricorn can seem boring to Libra, who wants more pleasure and harmony. Libra can be judged as too flippant by Capricorn.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Scorpio</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Scorpio (Water) can get along very well. The ambitious Capricorn brings structure and practicality to Scorpio, and Scorpio brings emotional intensity and loyalty to Capricorn. Both are determined and serious in their commitments.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fef2f2;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fca5a5;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#dc2626;\">3<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7f1d1d;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Sagittarius</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/><clipPath id=\"half\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"12\" height=\"24\"/></clipPath><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#dc2626\" clip-path=\"url(#half)\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Sagittarius (Fire) have few commonalities. The realistic, cautious Capricorn can frustrate the optimistic, carefree Sagittarius, and vice versa. Sagittarius lives in the moment; Capricorn plans the future.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Capricorn</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Two Capricorns together understand each other perfectly. They have the same ambitions and methods: work, organization, and discipline are at the core of their couple. They support each other to reach long-term goals. The relationship is very solid, though it may lack spontaneity.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#fef2f2;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #fca5a5;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#dc2626;\">2<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#7f1d1d;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Aquarius</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Aquarius (Air) have very low compatibility. The rebellious, collective-oriented Aquarius can seem too distant to the ambitious, traditional Capricorn. They do not share the same priorities.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:#ecfdf5;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:white;border:2px solid #6ee7b7;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#059669;\">8<span style=\"font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;\">/10</span></span>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#065f46;margin:0;\">Capricorn + Pisces</h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.65;\">Capricorn (Earth) and Pisces (Water) complement each other well. The pragmatic Capricorn stabilizes Pisces'' dreams, while Pisces brings empathy and imagination to Capricorn. They share a deep sense of responsibility.</p>\n</div>","subsections":[]},{"id":"discover-more","title":"Discover more","content":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/aries-love-compatibility/\">Aries love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/taurus-love-compatibility/\">Taurus love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/gemini-love-compatibility/\">Gemini love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/cancer-love-compatibility/\">Cancer love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/leo-love-compatibility/\">Leo love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/virgo-love-compatibility/\">Virgo love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/libra-love-compatibility/\">Libra love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/scorpio-love-compatibility/\">Scorpio love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/sagittarius-love-compatibility/\">Sagittarius love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/aquarius-love-compatibility/\">Aquarius love compatibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/blog/pisces-love-compatibility/\">Pisces love compatibility</a></li>\n</ul>","subsections":[]}]'::jsonb,
